Package: plasmotrackr
Title: Read, Check and Score 'plasmotrack' Runs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Maxwell", "Murphy", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mm@maxmurphy.dev")
Description: Reads the Parquet Run stores written by the 'plasmotrack'
    transmission-network engine through 'DuckDB', applies the store's
    reader rule, and returns raw tables, per-Draw quantities and pooled
    summaries as tidy data.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/EPPIcenter/plasmotrack,
    https://eppicenter.github.io/plasmotrack/
BugReports: https://github.com/EPPIcenter/plasmotrack/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
